  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Square Dog, at 64 boulevard Maréchal Juin in Cagnes-sur-Mer, offers dog and cat grooming in this town between Nice and Antibes. Its Mappy listing (from Pages Jaunes) cites hand-stripping, clipping, scissor cuts, trimming, show grooming and walk-in grooming, as well as the sale of shampoos, accessories, leashes, collars and clothes for dogs. The Google Maps listing shows 4.8/5 from 80 reviews.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>No official page of the salon could be opened on 19/11/2026: the website announced on Google Maps, square-dog.fr, was not responding. The address and the phone number, 04 93 20 71 94, match between Google Maps and Mappy. The hours found are the same on both: Tuesday to Friday from 9am to 6:30pm, Saturday from 9am to 2pm, closed Monday and Sunday. A call beforehand remains useful to confirm slots and to find out whether your dog can be taken without an appointment.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: call before coming, especially in the summer season.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The Cagnes-sur-Mer seafront and the medieval village of Haut-de-Cagnes, with its cobbled lanes and castle, are nearby for a walk before or after grooming.</p>
